# Byte-exact cross-repo gates -> everything here MUST be LF.
#
# This is the only maintained workspace template with no .gitattributes; its four
# siblings (claude-code / hermes / openclaw / google-adk) all carry exactly these
# rules. Three gates compare bytes:
#   * .gitea/workflows/ci.yml "askpass helper drift guard (audit E1)" pins
#     sha256sum scripts/molecule-askpass against a literal digest shared by all
#     templates.
#   * molecule-ci scripts/check-askpass-drift.py fetches that same blob from all
#     four template repos and asserts one distinct sha256.
#   * .gitea/workflows/sync-providers-yaml.yml byte-compares
#     internal/providers/providers.yaml against the controlplane canonical.
# A CRLF checkout or commit from a core.autocrlf=true box changes those bytes and
# reds all three. Pin LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
